==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~14 seconds<sup>300f~420f</sup>.
*4 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.
*4 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 8~20 seconds<sup>240f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6~8 seconds<sup>180f~240f</sup>.
*4 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Le'saint]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Stall the Ginger Snaches and beginning enemies and save up for long-ranged units such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]], but make sure to include [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] in your lineup. Once you have enough for Bahamut, Le'saint should be no problem to defeat.

